<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λίβῠς</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠος</span>, ὁ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a Libyan</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.181
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				702
			</span></i>, etc.: and as Adj., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λιβυκός, αὐλός</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				346
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λ. καυλός,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίλφιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				217.13
			</span></i>:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λίβυσσα</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.105
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.189
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Riv.Fil.</u>
				57.379
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Crete</span>):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λῐβυστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				292
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				139
			</span></i>, etc.; fem. also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λῐβυστίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1753
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λιβύη</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> harmless kind of <i>serpent</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				490
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λουτροφόρος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
